<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FAI sees higher 1996/97 profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FAI sees higher 1996/97 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAI Insurances Ltd's managing director Rodney Adler said he expected the company would achieve higher earnings in the current financial year.</p>
<p>&quot;We are certainly on track for a better profit this year,&quot; Adler told reporters after the annual meeting, repeating comments made in early September when FAI reported a A$10.4 million net profit for 1995/96 ended June 30.</p>
<p>Adler also said the company was still in discussions with potential joint venture partners about its A$250 million St Moritz Hotel in New York.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
